# One text convention for every platform: committed files are LF.
#
# This plugin is authored on Windows and installed on Windows, Linux and macOS
# profiles, and DSH reads its JavaScript, YAML and JSON directly — a CRLF working
# copy would still run, but line endings that flip per machine make reviews and
# diffs noisy for no benefit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only fixtures, if any are ever added, keep their endings.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary

# Keep the GitHub language bar honest about this being a JavaScript plugin.
*.md linguist-documentation
